<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40367" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rāmex</span></b> , ĭcis,
			m.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> (In
				plur.) <i>The blood-vessels of the
				lungs</i>, <i><span class="en">Plaut. Merc. 1, 27</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Poen.
				3, 1, 37</span></i>; Varr. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 166,
			12</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
				(<i>Sing.</i> and plur.) <i>A rupture</i>, <i>hernia</i>, <i>varicocele</i>, <i><span class="en">Cels. 7,
			18</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 22, 25, 57, § 121</span></i>; <i><span class="en">30, 15, 47, §
			137</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 10, 205</span></i>; Lucil. ap.
					<i><span class="en">Non. 166,
			15</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A staff</i>, <i><span class="en">Col. 9, 1,
			3</span></i>.</div>
